d isPermaLink="false">8c2f50ef6fe4</guid><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 20:23:43 GMT</pubDate><source>OFweek 激光频道</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>After 40 years of the ‘green problem,’ the quiet laser explains itself</title><link>https://www.laserfocusworld.com/lasers-sources/article/55412923/after-40-years-of-the-green-problem-the-quiet-laser-explains-itself</link><description>Intracavity-doubled green lasers within thousands of laboratories have been quiet for years without anyone knowing why. The answer is the opposite of the obvious one: A nonlinear crystal makes every mode noisier, but the total goes quiet anyway.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">a42846270949</guid><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 20:23:43 GMT</pubDate><source>Laser Focus World</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>Quantum dot lasers may unlock next era of AI optical interconnects</title><link>https://www.laserfocusworld.com/lasers-sources/article/55412860/veeco-instruments-inc-quantum-dot-lasers-may-unlock-next-era-of-ai-optical-interconnects</link><description>A misconception about quantum dot lasers (QDLs) is they’re poised to replace indium phosphide (InP) technology. But InP externally modulated lasers (EMLs) will continue serving optical networking and datacom applications, while QDLs emerge for applications that require power efficiency, thermal resilience, and integration density.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">ca057a739bad</guid><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 20:23:43 GMT</pubDate><source>Laser Focus World</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>Buy vs. build a laser beam analysis solution: 11 considerations</title><link>https://www.laserfocusworld.com/test-measurement/article/55410268/ophir-an-mks-brand-buy-vs-build-a-laser-beam-analysis-solution-11-considerations</link><description>Should you buy or build a laser beam analyzer? Navigate the hidden complexity behind this question by exploring 11 key considerations.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">157e8773f186</guid><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 20:23:43 GMT</pubDate><source>Laser Focus World</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>Are high-power laser diodes ready to power inertial fusion energy?</title><link>https://www.laserfocusworld.com/lasers-sources/article/55410022/leonardo-electronics-us-inc-are-high-power-laser-diodes-ready-to-power-inertial-fusion-energy</link><description>As inertial fusion energy moves from scientific breakthrough to commercial reality, scalable and cost-effective laser hardware is the key to moving from laboratory demonstrations to viable power plants—and low-cost, fusion-grade laser diodes can be manufactured at scale in Arizona to anchor a global inertial fusion energy supply chain.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">807e30bca7fd</guid><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 20:23:43 GMT</pubDate><source>Laser Focus World</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>营收增长74.28%，净利润增长109.99%，光纤激光大厂“爆发”！</title><link>https://www.coema.org.cn/industry/202610/5887.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">71e7a1834f40</guid><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 20:23:43 GMT</pubDate><source>COEMA 中国光电子行业协会</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>号称全球最大？满产3000台/年的飞秒激光器工厂开业</title><link>https://laser.ofweek.com/2026-10/ART-8100-2400-30708111.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">f45bf2d12a46</guid><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 20:23:43 GMT</pubDate><source>OFweek 激光频道</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>从激光雷达到机器人关节：禾赛为什么要做物理 AI 的基础设施？</title><link>https://laser.ofweek.com/2026-10/ART-240001-8420-30707291.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">1613d7c472e2</guid><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 20:23:43 GMT</pubDate><source>OFweek 激光频道</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>深度观察：超快激光在材料科学中的应用</title><link>https://laser.ofweek.com/2023-11/ART-8500-2400-30617123.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">82720c0f04d3<